      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "a",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>Spent &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b\u02bel-Mun\u0101 al-F\u0101m\u012b,</li>\n<li>on the date of&nbsp; Tuesday,</li>\n<li>the 27th</li>\n<li>Shevat of the year 127 of the documents:</li>\n<li>(6-7) Clay, 9&frac12;. A basket, &frac12; + \u215b. A rope (for the well), 1.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(8-9) Gypsum, 10. A meal, 2. Straw, 10&frac12;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(10-11) Helpers, 12. A mason, 5.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(12-13) Transportation of straw, 2&frac14;. Half a palm tree &hellip;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>The second day of &hellip;.</li>\n<li>(15-16) Clay, 3&frac12;. Nails, &frac34;. A meal, 1&frac12;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(17-20) Two helpers, 8. A mason, 5 &hellip;. Gypsum &hellip;.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
