      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "d",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>The remainder from&nbsp; the captives:</li>\n<li>Our Master al-Shaykh Ab\u016b\u02bel-Mun\u0101,</li>\n<li>one dinar, and another dinar.</li>\n<li>AI-Rash\u012bd, the sugar refinery,</li>\n<li>dinars in&nbsp; silver:</li>\n<li>AI-Shaykh Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r b.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Mak\u0101rim al-Qazaz\u0101n, one eighth.</li>\n<li>(9-11) (A)b\u016b\u02bel-Khayr Ibn N\u0101j\u012b, one eighth, 9.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(Coptic numerals)</li>\n<li>(13-14) \u1e6c\u0101hir \u27e6al-Baqq\u0101l\u27e7 al-\u02bfAnbar\u012b, a quarter.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
